    "sections": {
        "description": "Ovation Car Wash is a visually appealing and modern theme designed for car wash, auto detailing, and vehicle care businesses. This theme provides an intuitive platform for promoting services like car cleaning, auto repair, car polishing, auto spa treatments, and vehicle maintenance. Its sleek and professional design offers easy navigation and helps in showcasing essential services such as car wash booking, service packages, and detailing plans, making it a valuable tool for any car wash or auto service business. Built with a powerful booking and appointment scheduling plugin, it allows customers to easily book car wash or repair services online while helping businesses manage appointments efficiently. The theme’s customizable features let you highlight offerings like exterior and interior cleaning, ceramic coating, tire polishing, and mechanic services. With high-quality images, call-to-action sections, and a fully responsive layout, it ensures a seamless browsing experience across all devices. Its SEO-friendly structure, clean typography, and modern visuals help improve online visibility, increase customer engagement, and boost conversions for auto detailing shops, car spa centers, and vehicle service providers. Demo: https://trial.ovationthemes.com/ovation-car-wash/"
    },
